15 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>", "post_number": 4, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 27, "updated_at": "2026-04-28T18:39:50.338Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 2, "reads": 25, "readers_count": 24, "score": 20.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 189764, "topic_slug": "how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44", "display_username": "Magic Display", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 16174, "username": "theprogram", "name": "MatH", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 9915, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "via_email": true, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44/189764/4", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 498004, "name": "MatH", "username": "theprogram", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png", "created_at": "2026-04-28T18:44:23.077Z", "cooked": "<p>It looks like 44 is trying to replace upower powerprofiles with tuned<br>\nThey are conflicting powermanagement apps.</p>\n<p>I am not 100% sure, as I am on a different system, but we should be able to disable or remove the upower power profiles with</p>\n<p>sudo dnf remove upower</p>\n<p>and then run the update again.</p>\n<p>If you would prefer to try and disable upower instead, we can look that up.</p>", "post_number": 5, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 27, "updated_at": "2026-04-28T18:44:23.077Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 4, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 2, "reads": 22, "readers_count": 21, "score": 19.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 189764, "topic_slug": "how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44", "display_username": "MatH", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": "mindshare", "flair_url": "book-atlas", "flair_bg_color": "51a2daff", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 63, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Welcome Wagon", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 9915, "username": "magic", "name": "Magic Display", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/afea85/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16174, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44/189764/5", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 498005, "name": "Magic Display", "username": "magic", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/afea85/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-04-28T18:45:07.000Z", "cooked": "<p>Hi, Wine is removed and the install got as far as the screenshot shows, so how to clear the last conflicting packages, for the install to complete.</p>\n<p>Thanks</p>", "post_number": 6, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 27, "updated_at": "2026-04-28T18:45:14.373Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 2, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1, "reads": 23, "readers_count": 22, "score": 14.6, "yours": false, "topic_id": 189764, "topic_slug": "how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44", "display_username": "Magic Display", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 16174, "username": "theprogram", "name": "MatH", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 9915, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "via_email": true, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44/189764/6", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 498010, "name": "MatH", "username": "theprogram", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png", "created_at": "2026-04-28T18:48:42.659Z", "cooked": "<p>Looking again, you might have to <code>dnf remove tuned</code> as well as upower.</p>", "post_number": 7, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 27, "updated_at": "2026-04-28T18:48:42.659Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 6, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 22, "readers_count": 21, "score": 9.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 189764, "topic_slug": "how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44", "display_username": "MatH", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": "mindshare", "flair_url": "book-atlas", "flair_bg_color": "51a2daff", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 63, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Welcome Wagon", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 9915, "username": "magic", "name": "Magic Display", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/afea85/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16174, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44/189764/7", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 498013, "name": "Magic Display", "username": "magic", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/afea85/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-04-28T18:54:49.000Z", "cooked": "<p>Here is the readout from the Remove command;<br>\n$ sudo dnf remove upower<br>\n[sudo] password for frank:<br>\nFailed to resolve the transaction:<br>\nProblem: installed package gnome-shell-49.6-1.fc43.x86_64 requires upower(x86-64), but none of the providers can be installed</p>\n<ul>\n<li>conflicting requests</li>\n<li>problem with installed package</li>\n</ul>\n<p>So now what can we try?</p>", "post_number": 8, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 27, "updated_at": "2026-04-28T18:54:58.461Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 5, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 0, "reads": 22, "readers_count": 21, "score": 9.4, "yours": false, "topic_id": 189764, "topic_slug": "how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44", "display_username": "Magic Display", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 16174, "username": "theprogram", "name": "MatH", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 9915, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "via_email": true, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44/189764/8", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 498015, "name": "MatH", "username": "theprogram", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png", "created_at": "2026-04-28T18:56:27.252Z", "cooked": "<p>Try to only remove tuned</p>", "post_number": 9, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 27, "updated_at": "2026-04-28T18:56:27.252Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 8, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 1, "reads": 20, "readers_count": 19, "score": 14.0, "yours": false, "topic_id": 189764, "topic_slug": "how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44", "display_username": "MatH", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": "mindshare", "flair_url": "book-atlas", "flair_bg_color": "51a2daff", "flair_color": "", "flair_group_id": 63, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": "Welcome Wagon", "title_is_group": false, "reply_to_user": {"id": 9915, "username": "magic", "name": "Magic Display", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/afea85/{size}.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 16174, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 4, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44/189764/9", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_user_used_main_reaction": false, "can_accept_answer": false, "can_unaccept_answer": false, "accepted_answer": false, "topic_accepted_answer": true}, {"id": 498018, "name": "Magic Display", "username": "magic", "avatar_template": "https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/m/afea85/{size}.png", "created_at": "2026-04-28T18:59:24.000Z", "cooked": "<p>Hi,<br>\nhere is the readout from remove tuned, I haven’t clicked on the y/N yet, I wanted to see what you think before I click on yes.</p>\n<p>$ sudo dnf remove tuned<br>\nPackage Arch Version Repository Size<br>\nRemoving:<br>\ntuned noarch 2.27.0-1.fc43 updates 1.6 MiB<br>\nRemoving dependent packages:<br>\ntuned-ppd noarch 2.27.0-1.fc43 updates 7.0 KiB<br>\nRemoving unused dependencies:<br>\nlibpfm x86_64 4.13.0-16.fc43 fedora 1.7 MiB<br>\nlibtraceevent x86_64 1.8.4-4.fc43 fedora 1.4 MiB<br>\npython3-inotify noarch 0.9.6-42.fc43 fedora 297.0 KiB<br>\npython3-linux-procfs noarch 0.7.3-11.fc43 fedora 91.9 KiB<br>\npython3-perf x86_64 6.19.14-200.fc43 updates 9.7 MiB<br>\nvirt-what x86_64 1.27-4.fc43 fedora 68.2 KiB</p>\n<p>Transaction Summary:<br>\nRemoving: 8 packages</p>\n<p>After this operation, 15 MiB will be freed (install 0 B, remove 15 MiB).<br>\nIs this ok [y/N]:</p>", "post_number": 10, "post_type": 1, "posts_count": 27, "updated_at": "2026-04-28T18:59:31.563Z", "reply_count": 1, "reply_to_post_number": 7, "quote_count": 0, "incoming_link_count": 3, "reads": 21, "readers_count": 20, "score": 24.2, "yours": false, "topic_id": 189764, "topic_slug": "how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44", "display_username": "Magic Display", "primary_group_name": null, "flair_name": null, "flair_url": null, "flair_bg_color": null, "flair_color": null, "flair_group_id": null, "badges_granted": [], "version": 1, "can_edit": false, "can_delete": false, "can_recover": false, "can_see_hidden_post": false, "can_wiki": false, "read": true, "user_title": null, "reply_to_user": {"id": 16174, "username": "theprogram", "name": "MatH", "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discussion.fedoraproject.org/theprogram/{size}/53169_2.png"}, "bookmarked": false, "actions_summary": [], "moderator": false, "admin": false, "staff": false, "user_id": 9915, "hidden": false, "trust_level": 1, "deleted_at": null, "user_deleted": false, "edit_reason": null, "can_view_edit_history": true, "wiki": false, "via_email": true, "mentioned_users": [], "post_url": "/t/how-to-clear-old-unused-wine-packages-from-fed-43-for-new-install-fed-44/189764/10", "event": null, "reactions": [], "current_user_reaction": null, "reaction_users_count": 0, "current_use